{"5025010":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Farm to Fortune","steam_appid":5025010,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5111910,5128060],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌱Grow Your Crops<\/h2>Unlock new crops as your farm grows, each with its own growth time and price. Some pay fast, some pay big.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/a22fff5b3fea2429dc0994d2fa7a6d07.poster.avif?t=1793648053\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/a22fff5b3fea2429dc0994d2fa7a6d07.webm?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/a22fff5b3fea2429dc0994d2fa7a6d07.mp4?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Sell in Your Farm Shop<\/h2>Everything you grow lands on your shelves, and every sale brings the next upgrade a little closer.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/19eea76c809db2c534751507d1baaa8e.poster.avif?t=1793648053\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/19eea76c809db2c534751507d1baaa8e.webm?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/19eea76c809db2c534751507d1baaa8e.mp4?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Reinvest and Upgrade<\/h2>Better tools, faster growth, bigger yields. There's always a next upgrade on the horizon.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/9b6fa66038af667be721bd4702f9fece.poster.avif?t=1793648053\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/9b6fa66038af667be721bd4702f9fece.webm?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/9b6fa66038af667be721bd4702f9fece.mp4?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺️ Expand Your Land<\/h2>When the money comes in, the fences move out. Buy new fields and watch your farm grow far beyond that first little plot.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/0bbf26d1e6846371f2c0aca5f4dfb755.poster.avif?t=1793648053\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/0bbf26d1e6846371f2c0aca5f4dfb755.webm?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/0bbf26d1e6846371f2c0aca5f4dfb755.mp4?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >☕ Relax, It'll Grow<\/h2>Ten minutes or a whole afternoon, the farm is always happy to see you. No pressure, ever.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/333e8e3dd5b20bc7a18b5aaacd13b962.poster.avif?t=1793648053\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/333e8e3dd5b20bc7a18b5aaacd13b962.webm?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/333e8e3dd5b20bc7a18b5aaacd13b962.mp4?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>🌱Grow Your Crops<\/li><li>💰 Sell in Your Farm Shop<\/li><li>🛠️ Reinvest and Upgrade<\/li><li>🗺️ Expand Your Land<\/li><li>☕ Relax, It'll Grow<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌱Grow Your Crops<\/h2>Unlock new crops as your farm grows, each with its own growth time and price. Some pay fast, some pay big.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/a22fff5b3fea2429dc0994d2fa7a6d07.poster.avif?t=1793648053\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/a22fff5b3fea2429dc0994d2fa7a6d07.webm?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/a22fff5b3fea2429dc0994d2fa7a6d07.mp4?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Sell in Your Farm Shop<\/h2>Everything you grow lands on your shelves, and every sale brings the next upgrade a little closer.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/19eea76c809db2c534751507d1baaa8e.poster.avif?t=1793648053\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/19eea76c809db2c534751507d1baaa8e.webm?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/19eea76c809db2c534751507d1baaa8e.mp4?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Reinvest and Upgrade<\/h2>Better tools, faster growth, bigger yields. There's always a next upgrade on the horizon.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/9b6fa66038af667be721bd4702f9fece.poster.avif?t=1793648053\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/9b6fa66038af667be721bd4702f9fece.webm?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/9b6fa66038af667be721bd4702f9fece.mp4?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺️ Expand Your Land<\/h2>When the money comes in, the fences move out. Buy new fields and watch your farm grow far beyond that first little plot.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/0bbf26d1e6846371f2c0aca5f4dfb755.poster.avif?t=1793648053\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/0bbf26d1e6846371f2c0aca5f4dfb755.webm?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/0bbf26d1e6846371f2c0aca5f4dfb755.mp4?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >☕ Relax, It'll Grow<\/h2>Ten minutes or a whole afternoon, the farm is always happy to see you. No pressure, ever.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/333e8e3dd5b20bc7a18b5aaacd13b962.poster.avif?t=1793648053\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/333e8e3dd5b20bc7a18b5aaacd13b962.webm?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/extras\/333e8e3dd5b20bc7a18b5aaacd13b962.mp4?t=1793648053\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>🌱Grow Your Crops<\/li><li>💰 Sell in Your Farm Shop<\/li><li>🛠️ Reinvest and Upgrade<\/li><li>🗺️ Expand Your Land<\/li><li>☕ Relax, It'll Grow<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Turn a tiny plot into a fortune, one seed at a time. Grow crops, sell them in your shop, and reinvest everything you earn. Better tools, more land, richer harvests. Relaxing from the first seed to the last field.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/e4e5eaf786cc6e043d42f4220d736a7b4abfbfac\/header.jpg?t=1793648053","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/ff1d08c428a563cbc8cf4dc0a87fe8b06f0ae802\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793648053","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5025010\/ff1d08c428a563cbc8cf4dc0a87fe8b06f0ae802\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793648053","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor: